{
  "schema": "t01-request-result-pairs",
  "contractVersion": "1.0",
  "version": "t01-pairs-v1.1-candidate",
  "note": "P01 营养收口 A–J 的请求/结果配对样例。每对为 ComputeNutritionTarget 的完整必要输入与输出；数值可自含复算，不代表已运行业务代码、算法、构建或真机，也不代表 P09 已复核。",
  "recomputeNotes": [
    "REE_mkcal = 10*weightGrams + 625*heightMm - 5000*ageYears + sexTerm (男+5000, 女-161000)。",
    "TDEE_mkcal = round_half_up(REE_mkcal*activityFactorPermille, 1000)。",
    "缺口_mkcal = min(round_half_up(TDEE_mkcal*fatLossDeficitPermille,1000), 300000)；目标 kcal = round_half_up(TDEE-缺口,1000)。",
    "蛋白 dg = round_half_up(proteinMgPerKg*weightGrams,100000)；脂肪 kcal = round_half_up(目标kcal*fatEnergyPermille,1000)；脂肪 dg = round_half_up(脂肪kcal*10,9)；蛋白 kcal = round_half_up(蛋白dg*4,10)；碳水 kcal = 目标-蛋白-脂肪；碳水 dg = round_half_up(碳水kcal*10,4)。",
    "宏量能量 tenths kcal = 4*proteinDg + 9*fatDg + 4*carbDg；比例判定用交叉相乘，显示 bp = round_half_up(component*10000,total)。",
    "手动容差 tenths kcal = max(200, floor(targetEnergyKcal*10*2/100))；|宏量能量-声明能量| <= 容差为容差内。",
    "BMI 比较：weightGrams*10000 < 185*heightMm*heightMm（未舍入）；显示 tenths 才舍入。"
  ],
